    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should check with the dr but they're super hard to reach and i'm in a lot of pain right now. you sound like you know your stuff though... like is there any actual serious danger or is it just a \"check with your doctor\" kind of thing? i just don't want to end up in the ER if i can just take one pill and sleep.",
